WEBVTT

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:08.500
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:15.580
ima wa ugokenai sore ga sadame dakedo

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:15.580
Right now I can't move... That is my fate, but...

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:20.720
akirame wa shinai mou mezameta kara

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:20.720
I won't give up anymore because I have awakened.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.890
moeru tokimeki wa jidai wo utsushi

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:25.890
My burning, throbbing heart reflects the era...

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:31.060
iro azayaka ni moesakaru honoo

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:31.060
It has the color of vividly blazing flames...

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.820
Crying ima wa mienaku tomo

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.820
Crying, though I can't see it right now...

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.350
Searching michi shirube wa ukabu

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.350
Searching, a guidepost floats up ahead.

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.170
I wanna have a pure time!

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:48.280
Everyone's a noble mind!

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:53.500
soko ni nokotta wakasa toridashi

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:53.500
I'll take out what remains of my youth there,

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.980
Believing a sign of Zeta,

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.540
beyond the hard times from now!

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:06.320
kawaku kuchibiru nureteiru nara

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:06.320
If these dry lips become wet,

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.460
toki wo norikoe atsui jidai e to

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:11.460
Beyond time, towards a passionate era,

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.500
utsuru darou to shinjiteiru kara

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.500
Because I believe it will move...

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.060
Believing a sign of Zeta,

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:23.690
beyond the hard times from now...

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:35.100
Emma's Decision

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:04.320
Lieutenant Emma is boarding Unit 1!

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:05.790
I'm allowing it! Let her go!

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.630
Unit 3! Get a grip on yourself!

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:14.270
No! Kamille!

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:19.700
D-Damn you!

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.810
This guy... this scum!

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:23.870
This guy did it!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.720
Damn it! I've run out of ammo! Spare!

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:31.250
Bastard!

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.020
Th-This guy! He's A.E.U.G.?!

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.420
He's not firing!

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.760
<i>You killed my mom!</i>

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.160
Your mom?!

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.530
What in the world are you talking about?!

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.330
Get away from him, Kamille!

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.400
Jerid! Stop!

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.370
Unit 3 is being piloted by a kid!

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:00.450
We have no information indicating
the A.E.U.G. have any Hizacks.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.580
<i>They shouldn't have any.</i>

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:04.650
"Shouldn't" isn't good enough.
I need a definite answer!

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:06.590
<i>They don't have any!</i>

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:23.970
Get rid of the ones following!

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:38.850
You didn't have to...

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.250
<i>...kill her!</i>

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:45.460
<i>You didn't have to kill her!</i>

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:47.160
That voice. Who is it?

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.140
Kamille, was it?

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.970
The kid with a girl's name?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.480
He's not getting me!

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.070
I'll use the vulcan!

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.230
I'm out of ammo!

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.670
Kamille! Jerid! Get away from each other!

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.680
Don't interfere!

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:37.750
Emma?!

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:39.610
Stop it, Kamille!

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:42.350
Any other weapons? Doesn't this
have any other weapons?!

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.320
- A beam...
- ...saber!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:55.600
Emma!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.030
Is that...

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.600
...what the previous attack was?!

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.010
Enemy or ally?! What's the idea?!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.550
I'm a Titan!

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.380
I don't believe either of us will gain
anything from a meaningless battle!

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:16.440
Give the enemy more time
to think this over!

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.590
Kamille's lost it, poor kid.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.300
<i>We're at a disadvantage!</i>

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:32.890
Are you suggesting that
I abide by Bask's orders?

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:33.940
<i>We have no choice!</i>

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:37.570
But Bask... Bask himself
is right at our doorstep!

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.600
<i>Lieutenant Emma Sheen does not want</i>
<i>to fight this battle!</i>

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:42.750
- We don't know for sure!
- <i>I know it!</i>

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.810
Are you trusting a Titans member?!

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.580
<i>We can trust her.</i>

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:50.080
- I agree with Lieutenant Quattro Bajeena.
- Captain!

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:51.750
<i>Signing off!</i>

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:13.840
You and your family could be executed
for ignoring a cease-fire!

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:22.750
Stop it, Kamille! The battle is over!

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.850
Let go! Don't interfere!

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:28.760
Wait! Bastard!

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.200
<i>Calm down, Kamille!</i>

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:39.200
Shut up! Let go of me!

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.400
<i>Kamille Bidan! Stop that at once!</i>

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:43.670
<i>There's nothing more disgraceful</i>
<i>than a hysterical man!</i>

00:06:43.740 --> 00:06:44.730
But...!

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:46.870
But my mom was killed right
in front of my eyes!

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.280
How could you say such a thing?!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.050
<i>Stop it! Don't stick pins into him</i>
<i>any further!</i>

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.380
But...

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.520
- We're handing over the Gundams.
- <i>Y- You are?</i>

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.150
Ensign, please take charge!

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.690
Lieutenant Quattro Bajeena, right?

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.320
Are you sure about this?

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:04.250
<i>I wouldn't have given out</i>
<i>a cease-fire signal otherwise.</i>

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:07.160
<i>But I'm worried about Kamille's condition.</i>

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.900
<i>I'm going outside.</i>

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.830
I will too, Lieutenant.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:30.280
<i>Open up, Kamille! Are you all right?!</i>

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.250
<i>Kamille.</i>

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.430
Has an agreement been reached
on the transfer of the Gundam Mk. IIs?

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:16.120
So allowing Franklin Bidan to live
is not a bad move...

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:19.900
...because we could convince him to
join the A.E.U.G..

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:21.760
Is that right?

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:26.270
If you're satisfied with that reasoning,
then please think of it that way.

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.740
How about Emma Sheen?
Is she a Newtype?

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:32.350
I can't be sure, but I am pretty confident
that she isn't with the Titans.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.360
Captain!

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.760
Our military forces have doubled.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.820
We can now crush the Argama
in a single attack.

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.770
Yes, sir. Let's do it.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.940
- Not yet?!
- It's been locked from the inside.

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:57.210
We're presently sending a code
to release the lock.

00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:00.440
It'll open now!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.440
So we finally meet, Kamille.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.110
Answer me.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.020
Was Lieutenant Hilda in the capsule?

00:09:12.460 --> 00:09:14.360
Well, was she?! Wasn't she?!

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:15.720
It was obvious, wasn't it?!

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.930
So you're saying it wasn't a hologram!

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.430
The fingers of Unit 3 will prove it.

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:21.720
Fingers?

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.740
Let go, you murderers!

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:39.870
If you want me to go, then I'll go
without any help!

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:42.590
Dad...!

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:46.150
Kamille!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.730
Kamille...!

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.530
Dad.

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:02.900
Mom's dead.

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:07.480
She was killed by the Titans.

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:10.350
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.350
Is that true?

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:15.180
You and mom were hostages.

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:19.220
Kamille!

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:22.860
Now things will go a lot smoother
with your young lover.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.330
Margarita, was it?!

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:25.890
Stop that!

00:10:26.360 --> 00:10:27.330
But it's true, right?!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.500
Wh-Why did your mom have to die?!
Huh?!

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.030
I have no idea!

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.430
I-I was only trying to rescue her!

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:39.210
<i>The people responsible for her death</i>
<i>are on this ship!</i>

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:42.250
A mistress...!

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:44.410
So you're saying Captain Bask
was behind it, right?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:54.320
Wouldn't you say this is great news
for your mistress?

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.400
Your mom! Your dear mommy!

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:12.540
I had no idea that your mother
was in that capsule.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:17.580
It must be hard, since you're
still a baby.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.880
Go ahead and hit me,
like you did at the spaceport before.

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:27.550
I see.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.690
I know that it's a serviceman's fate.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:34.490
A military officer must abide
by the orders of his superior...

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.760
...without even considering
the circumstances surrounding him.

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.670
I forgive you!

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:43.100
I'm good enough to beat you
and your Hizack.

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:47.370
It's the fault of the military that this
resulted regardless of my efforts.

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:52.110
So I learned today that I must direct
my hatred toward that organization!

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:53.880
Wait, come back!

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:55.890
Stop it. You've already lost this fight!

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:58.050
If that bothers you, then have some
self respect...

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.090
...like a Titan should and move on.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:15.630
I have an idea, Lieutenant.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:16.830
Sir?

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:19.640
I would prefer not to use hostages
if I can help it.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.280
Next time, why don't you show me how
<i>you</i> would've handled the situation.

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:24.310
How I would've?

00:12:24.520 --> 00:12:29.650
I want you to capture the Argama's
new mobile suit in a fair manner.

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:32.020
I know you can do it, Lieutenant...

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:36.520
...since you are so capable that you're
willing to disagree with me.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:37.560
But, sir!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:39.650
I don't expect you to do it all on your own.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:43.560
I'll allow you to work out a combined
strategy with Lila's unit.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:47.860
You're also free to use
the three Gundam Mk. IIs.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.130
Captain! If I may be allowed to use
a Gundam Mk. II...

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:55.150
...I wish to have the chance
to make up for my disgrace...!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:56.610
Make up for your disgrace?!

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:00.980
You need to first show you're capable of it!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.150
What do you think,
Lieutenant Emma Sheen?

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:14.000
Yes, I have a feeling Lieutenant Emma
will be back soon.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.670
<i>The Commodore is not placing</i>
<i>much hope on it...</i>

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.960
<i>...but we'll remain in this area</i>
<i>for the time being just the same.</i>

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.900
<i>Personally, I'd like to see</i>
<i>Lieutenant Emma again.</i>

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:23.500
So would I.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:39.550
You know how to operate
a Gundam Mk. II, I trust.

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.580
Of course. I was the one who developed it.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:46.560
Please accept my condolences
for the loss of your wife.

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:48.500
Thank you.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:52.260
Will you consider escaping
the Alexandria with me?

00:13:53.370 --> 00:13:56.430
To the A.E.U.G.? You're going to the Argama,
I take it.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.870
- Yes.
- What if I refuse?

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.470
I understand.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:03.740
Let's go.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:13.050
I'm leaving the Alexandria.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.790
Do you have the courage to join me?

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:16.830
- With you?
- That's right!

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:18.860
Have the courage?

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:21.190
Sure I do. If you're telling the truth.

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:22.590
Of course I am!

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.100
I'm not a child. I'm capable
of following you.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.100
Sorry.

00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:38.340
You invited my dad, too?!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:39.880
What's wrong with that?

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:45.250
Act like you're being escorted by me
until we get to the normal suits room.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.290
Very well.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:51.190
<i>What are you up to, dad?!</i>

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.890
Aren't you ready yet?!

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:58.030
Don't get so excited.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.800
- First time leading a platoon.
- Hurry!

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:02.100
What's going on?

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:03.770
Captain's orders.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:18.750
We'd better hurry!

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.820
You did well.

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:24.490
How about my normal suit?

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.360
You can't be wearing that!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:29.560
Kamille.

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:33.500
Have you piloted the A.E.U.G.'s
new mobile suit before?

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.930
The talking can wait
until we get to the Argama.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.580
Don't get me wrong.

00:15:40.650 --> 00:15:44.340
I'm not doing this because
I feel sorry for the two of you.

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.550
I know that.

00:15:49.150 --> 00:15:52.320
Lieutenant, walk with your back
straight, like a pilot would.

00:15:52.560 --> 00:15:54.150
You all leaving together?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.480
Please don't feel bad about it.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:01.830
How does it feel to lead a battle platoon,
Lieutenant Emma?!

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:03.720
Not bad at all.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.870
<i>I imagine so.</i>

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.460
<i>The others are Lieutenant Dava Baro</i>
<i>and Kacricon...!</i>

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:13.910
Kacricon would be in that one.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:15.870
Lieutenant Kacricon!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.540
<i>Each unit checked! Get 'em for sure!</i>

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.680
<i>This'll be Gundam Mk. II's</i>
<i>first actual battle!</i>

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:23.550
You've tried it out once, so take it easy!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:25.490
The Argama is the type of ship...!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:27.420
Hey! Kacricon! What's the matter?!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.560
Emma! What's going on?!
You're leaving too early!

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:36.170
The hatch isn't open yet! What's wrong?!

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:41.310
All three units?! What's going on?!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:42.270
Emma!

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:43.740
Lieutenant Emma Sheen!

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:46.670
<i>Open the hatch!</i>
<i>Or I'll blast it open!</i>

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:49.310
What's she saying?
You're not following procedures!

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:52.440
<i>Anyone not wearing normal suits</i>
<i>should make their way to the air lock!</i>

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:58.490
<i>I'll say it one more time! Open the hatch!</i>

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.960
If you don't open it, I'll blast it open!

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:03.850
- Lieutenant Franklin, status report?!
- <i>S- Satisfactory!</i>

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:05.420
- Kamille?!
- <i>Roger!</i>

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:10.930
Lieutenant Emma!
Wh-Why are you doing this?!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.860
Controller, don't open it!
That's not Lieutenant Kacricon!

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:17.270
Hm? What's going on?

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.300
This time, I'm using the beam rifle!

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.280
What was that tremor?

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:29.150
Lieutenant Emma has just stolen
the Gundam Mk. IIs!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.280
What?! What about Kacricon and Dava?!

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:36.360
Unit 2, Unit 3, follow me!

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:37.920
<i>I know. Go ahead!</i>

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:38.960
Taking off!

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:46.100
It's working great!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.300
Taking off!

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:53.470
Dad, I'm impressed.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.310
Kamille, taking off!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.490
What's going on?!
Is Lieutenant Emma defecting?!

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:11.150
<i>Lieutenant Emma has taken</i>
<i>Kamille Bidan and Franklin with her!</i>

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.890
Lieutenant Franklin, too?!

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:16.500
That traitor!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:28.110
It skimmed me!

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:34.450
I can't believe you let that hit you!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:45.850
I'll get you!

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:53.160
Don't worry, Lieutenant Emma.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:56.870
It's designed so that damages like that to a
nozzle won't affect overall performance!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:58.570
<i>Then you can follow me, can you?</i>

00:18:58.640 --> 00:19:01.340
<i>Of course. Although not at top speed.</i>

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:03.570
You must be kidding!

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:05.010
At that pace, they'll catch up with us!

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:07.020
Here's one already!

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:10.820
Kamille!

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.860
Unit 2 is fixed onto the course.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.360
If you wander away, you'll get lost!

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:15.410
<i>Roger!</i>

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.620
What a sight!
The Gundams all traveling together!

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:24.390
That pursuer is fast!

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:31.100
Dad always gets in the way!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.380
Hit it!

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:49.880
<i>The energy pack for the beam rifle</i>
<i>is not limitless!</i>

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.790
- <i>Be more patient!</i>
- Roger!

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:53.490
Lieutenant Quattro's hunch
was right on!

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:55.960
Measure the distance
to where the flashes are!

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:57.230
Are you certain?!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.930
The Mk. IIs are returning?!

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.270
I'm not positive, but I believe so!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:03.640
I hope that's the case!
Where's Lieutenant Quattro?!

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:24.580
Why can't you fire the rifle? You developed
that mobile suit yourself, right?!

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:28.130
Th-There's also the vulcan!

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:30.260
Unit 3?

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:38.230
Reinforcements?

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.940
What about our reinforcements
from the Alexandria?!

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:47.680
It's fast!

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:55.060
Why did I run out of energy?!

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:57.490
It got away!

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:02.990
We have three Gundam Mk. IIs.

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:05.100
Who are piloting them?

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:08.140
Lieutenant Quattro Bajeena's mobile suit?

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:10.670
It's an A.E.U.G. mobile suit!

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.110
Welcome back.

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:19.510
I owe it to Emma.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:24.790
Emma Sheen.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.520
Lieutenant Quattro Bajeena.

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:29.460
Lieutenant Emma.

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:33.050
I hate to say this, but I'm reluctant
to believe your change of heart.

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:36.200
The Titans are a group
of carefully selected people, after all.

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:38.860
I understand, Lieutenant Quattro.

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:42.030
Did something happen
at the Titans base?

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:45.600
No, rather, the change took place
within you.

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:46.700
Nothing special.

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:50.580
I wish to live with my own beliefs,
and from that point of view...

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:51.980
...nothing has changed.

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:55.580
That's right, Emma is a nice person.

00:22:05.330 --> 00:22:06.850
Lieutenant Franklin Bidan!

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.330
Dad?

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:14.200
Dad!

00:22:15.110 --> 00:22:17.570
This is a very well-designed
mobile suit.

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:26.750
Don't you have any understanding
of the present situation?!

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:50.220
There was a parent who could not
understand his son's feelings.

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:52.960
Kamille's father, Franklin,
takes Char's Rick Dias...

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:56.360
...and escapes from the Argama.

00:23:56.730 --> 00:23:58.670
All Kamille could do was watch
as his father floated away...

00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:02.030
...into the depths of outer space.

00:24:03.070 --> 00:24:07.530
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Father and Son".

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:12.470
Next Episode

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:12.470
Father and Son

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:10.050
You will see the tears of time.
